{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":489685,"name":"Rick Soto","username":"Rick_Soto","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/e495f1/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-12T23:39:17.097Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489685-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489685-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489685-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489685-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll Grok Bots silent on iOS — Agent Computer visible but no replies\u003cbr\u003e\nProduct: Grok Bot\u003cbr\u003e\nPlan: SuperGrok Plus\u003cbr\u003e\nDevice: iOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll bots on this account stopped responding around 1:25 PM PDT on Saturday, Sept 12, 2026.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBots: ATLAS, VIXEN, DAEDALUS\u003cbr\u003e\nEvery message fails / never gets a reply, including “hello”, “?”, “Stop now”, and “Update”.\u003cbr\u003e\nNew messages stay as sent bubbles with no bot response.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Agent Computer still opens. VIXEN’s computer view still showed Instagram logged in (vixenofficial2026) with other tabs open (Proton, Pinterest). So the VM is visible, but the reply pipeline is dead.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlready tried with no fix:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eForce-close and reopen Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e“Stop now” / simple health-check messages\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecover / Update Agent Computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWaiting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover or rebuild the Agent Computer on the backend.\u003cbr\u003e\nDo not wipe files, logins, or bot profiles if possible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI need the bots responding again. This is blocking paid SuperGrok Plus use.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489685-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489685-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on iOS (SuperGrok Plus).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen any bot: ATLAS, VIXEN, or DAEDALUS.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend “hello”, “?”, “Stop now”, or “Update”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo bot reply. Messages stay as sent bubbles.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the Agent Computer (monitor icon). Desktop still loads (Instagram was visible / logged in).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eForce-close app, reopen, retry. Same failure on all bots.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecover / Update Agent Computer did not restore replies.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489685-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489685-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBots reply in chat. If the computer is reachable, a simple message should get a response. All bots on the account should not go silent at once.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489685-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489685-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489685-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489685-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot iOS — version unknown (app Settings / About Grok Bot if listed)\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: iOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489685-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489685-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot default (not Sonnet). All bots on the shared Agent Computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489685-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489685-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover the Agent Computer on the backend. Computer view still opens; chat replies do not. Do not wipe files/logins if possible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489685-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489685-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T07:31:42.840Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":25.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171458,"topic_slug":"all-grok-bots-silent-on-ios-agent-computer-visible-but-no-replies","display_username":"Rick Soto","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137530,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/all-grok-bots-silent-on-ios-agent-computer-visible-but-no-replies/171458/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":489686,"name":"Discourse AI Spam Scanner","username":"discourse_ai_spam","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/c68b51/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-12T23:39:18.963Z","cooked":"","post_number":2,"post_type":3,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-12T23:39:18.963Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171458,"topic_slug":"all-grok-bots-silent-on-ios-agent-computer-visible-but-no-replies","display_username":"Discourse AI Spam Scanner","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":-3,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"action_code":"visible.disabled","post_url":"/t/all-grok-bots-silent-on-ios-agent-computer-visible-but-no-replies/171458/2","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":489772,"name":"system","username":"system","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/system/{size}/99069_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T06:46:52.319Z","cooked":"","post_number":6,"post_type":3,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T06:46:52.319Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171458,"topic_slug":"all-grok-bots-silent-on-ios-agent-computer-visible-but-no-replies","display_username":"system","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":-1,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"action_code":"visible.enabled","post_url":"/t/all-grok-bots-silent-on-ios-agent-computer-visible-but-no-replies/171458/6","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":489787,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T07:31:18.959Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. Good news: Agent Computer, the bots, files, and logins are all fine. Nothing needs to be rebuilt or recovered. That’s why VIXEN shows Instagram already open. The VM is alive. Only launching bot replies is failing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat actually happened: the account hit the weekly Grok Bot usage limit around the same time the bots went silent. After the limit is reached, new messages are still accepted, but the bots don’t run. So messages like “hello”, “?”, and “Stop now” just sit there as sent bubbles with no reply. The app should’ve shown a clear “usage limit reached” notice, but it didn’t. I’ve shared this with the team.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo get the bots working again, there are two options:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWait for the weekly reset. You can see the exact reset time in the Grok Bot app under Settings \u0026gt; Usage, or at \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/dashboard\"\u003ecursor.com/dashboard\u003c/a\u003e when you sign in with the same Grok account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnable On-Demand usage so the bots can run beyond the included amount. Go to \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/dashboard/spending\"\u003ecursor.com/dashboard/spending\u003c/a\u003e with the same Grok account, turn on On-Demand usage, and set a monthly spend limit you’re comfortable with. The bots should resume within a couple of minutes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease don’t buy Cursor Pro for this. On the SuperGrok plan, it doesn’t add Grok Bot usage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo notes: messages sent during the block stay queued. The bots will reply to them in a batch as soon as usage is available again. Scheduled routines that were due during the block were skipped. No need to press Recover, Reset, or Update. The computer is fine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if the bots still don’t come back after the reset or after enabling On-Demand.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T07:31:18.959Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171458,"topic_slug":"all-grok-bots-silent-on-ios-agent-computer-visible-but-no-replies","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cursor.com/dashboard","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0},{"url":"http://cursor.com/das